<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div><a class="upload-image ui-draggable" href="#"><img width="100%" height="" class="img-responsive" alt="" src="/uploads/images/6ab0248f9679e8529b2c269ba87403a8.jpg"></a></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; * 經過不停地測試在我們選定高質量的混合纖維素材後使用最優秀的編織法形成現在一隻隻的REVOLUTION船竿,</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;搭配FUJI ALCONITE 導環雖然重量略重但強度是同等級中最強,WEFOX宗旨就是希望釣魚這項活動可以用最適當</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 的價位選購到最優秀的產品,個配件都是經過巧思的</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* 這隻素材主要是是我們主理人一直追求的,高敏感度,高反撥力在"柔"與"剛"之間做出一個最完美的曲線,重量也許不</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;是同級最輕但因為可以在船架上做釣,所以配件都是選擇強度優先!</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;* 目標魚種例如黃雞,黑喉,春子,赤宗,馬頭,青物等等...甚至可以對應一年四季台灣幾乎都有的招牌白帶魚</span></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i><